# Operation Med-Trap — Redtail / XMRig Suricata Rules (one-line format)

alert tls $HOME_NET any -> $EXTERNAL_NET any (msg:"MALWARE Redtail/XMRig TLS SNI randomx.xmrig.com"; tls.sni; content:"randomx.xmrig.com"; nocase; sid:9001001; rev:1; priority:2; classtype:trojan-activity;)
